  + supplied package and file order are normalized before sealing so equivalent sets produce byte-identical results
  + logical source paths are inert portable names and cannot resolve host files
  + partial parser declarations diagnostics exact spans and source attribution remain visible without claiming complete semantic validity
  + whole-snapshot validation runs only after source diagnostics clear and semantic refusal becomes an attributed project diagnostic
