& [ThreatReview]
  + strict forms reject unknown fields duplicate semantic sets package/file identity collisions malformed profiles paths identifiers namespaces and versions
  + bounded tests cover maximum documents aggregate source bytes per-source bytes diagnostics dependency cycles machine bytes and result tamper
  + production dependencies and sources contain no filesystem database async transport process environment network provider CLI unsafe or effect surface
  + retained evidence independently rehashes four artifacts and five component files before focused replay

& [Residuals]
  + filesystem project discovery loading and persistence remain outside this component
  + read-only semantic query search revision drafts SQLite LSP MCP and provider/model hosting remain separate candidate slices
  + the implementation does not start SOP Eclipse as a process or authorize self-update
  + review is agent-produced and not an independent human audit

& [Disposition]
